used by log.event), an attr-set (`CTLV_ATTESTATION_SET_MR_LOG_EVENT`) and effectively the
reply set of the event op 'mr-log-entry-appended'. The event op is named
mr-log-entry-appended but its set is mr-log-event and it wraps 'notification.entry' whose
set is mr-log-entry. Pick one naming scheme; the enum and set sharing a name will bite as
soon as a name-keyed table is generated.

