attestation object size. If intentional say why; otherwise bound it. The ABI snapshot
also records no alignment for this blob, so alignment is not under ABI check.

> +      - name: object-length

object-length is a repeated uint (max-occurrences 16) reported in the reply, positional
with request.object. Nothing in the schema ties the number of reply entries to the number
of request objects; that invariant must be enforced by the handler. Document it in the
spec.

