The descriptor is exported in namespace "CTLV" from `drivers/attestation/generated`, i.e.
the symbol is exported by whichever module links this file, but the importer (TDX
family, patch 19/20) must then also `MODULE_IMPORT_NS("CTLV")` only if it is in a separate
module; the export namespace here is the *core's* namespace, not an attestation one. An
attestation-specific namespace would be less confusing. Also nothing in this patch uses
the export.

